# Build-time only. `sanity deploy` / `sanity build` bake .env values into the
# hosted Studio, and .env.local holds the LOCAL dev server URL — which would
# point the deployed Presentation tab at a machine nobody else is running.
# Vite gives .env.production priority over .env.local, so the hosted Studio
# previews the live site while `sanity dev` still uses .env.local.
SANITY_STUDIO_PREVIEW_URL=https://www.train321.com
